quick and hassle free as possible.\nIf you would like financing options and you are in the market to purchase a used car or truck, we will provide assistance to help you find financing options that fit your needs! Whether you have bad credit, no credit, or are a first time car buyer, you can trust that Auto Haus will get you into the car or truck you choose with professionalism and attention to your needs.\nAuto Haus has four locations all complete with an experienced and reliable Service department that is open extra hours to help fit our customers' hectic schedules, and as always, Auto Haus offers competitive pricing for your automotive maintenance needs. We also offer Alloy Wheel Repair whereby we can straighten bent wheels and TIG weld cracked wheels to factory specifications for your safety and peace of mind. Customer satisfaction is our highest priority, and our staff is committed to achieving this goal in every aspect of our business. Please feel free to reach us at (757) 898-1200 in Yorktown or (757) 585-7200 in Williamsburg or (757) 233-8600 in Virginia Beach and surrounding areas. If you have any questions or comments gives us a call or stop by any one of our locations today.","tokens":["Auto"," Haus"," in"," York","town",","," Williams","burg",","," and"," Virginia"," Beach"," serves"," the"," entire"," Virginia"," peninsula"," and"," the"," south","side","."," We"," are"," proud"," to"," be"," an"," automotive"," leader"," in"," our"," area"," offering"," vehicles"," sales",","," service",","," parts",","," paint"," &"," collision"," repair","."," Since"," opening"," our"," doors",","," Auto"," Haus"," has"," kept"," a"," firm"," commitment"," to"," our"," customers","."," We"," offer"," a"," wide"," selection"," of"," import"," and"," domestic"," vehicles"," like"," Mercedes",","," BMW",","," Honda",","," Lexus",","," Audi",","," Porsche",","," Hyundai",","," Kia",","," Volkswagen"," (","V","W","),"," Land"," Rover",","," Jaguar",","," Subaru",","," Spr