s in relation to each other and the centerline of the vehicle. These measurements can be adjusted to ensure that the vehicle's wheels are properly aligned for optimal performance, handling, and tire wear.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\nThat sounds great! Can you tell me more about American Five Star Car Care's services for wheel alignment Tempe?<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\nSure, American Five Star Car Care offers comprehensive services for wheel alignment in Tempe. Our services include computerized wheel alignment, which uses advanced technology to provide precision measurements and adjustment of the wheel angles. We also offer a steering angle sensor reset","tokens":["<|im_start|>","system","\n","You"," are"," a"," helpful"," assistant",".","<|im_end|>","\n","<|im_start|>","user","\n","How"," does"," a"," bump"," or"," accident"," affect"," the"," alignment"," of"," a"," vehicle","'s"," wheels",","," and"," what"," are"," the"," three"," measurements"," involved"," in"," a"," wheel"," alignment"," adjustment","?"," Answer"," according"," to",":"," Well"," Tem","pe"," it"," is"," finally"," here","."," The"," State"," Of"," Arizona"," first"," New"," Hunter"," Alignment"," System","."," Why"," you"," should"," care"," you"," ask","?"," Well"," this"," system"," doesn","'t"," need"," calibration"," so"," you"," will"," always"," have"," a"," straight"," ride"," the"," first"," time","."," Don","'t"," think"," for"," a"," minute"," that"," any"," alignment"," computer"," system"," is"," equal","."," Code"," link"," is"," the"," steering"," angle"," sensor"," reset","."," After"," ","2","0","1","2"," all"," vehicles"," in"," the"," U",".S",".A","."," Will"," Have"," this"," technology","."," Give"," me"," ","9","0"," seconds"," and"," I"," will"," give"," you"," an"," computer"," generated"," print"," out"," of"," your"," steering"," and"," suspension"," system","."," If"," all"," you"," need"," is"," an"," adjustment"," American"," Five"," Star"," Car"," Care"," w